  node [
    id 6
    label "VH4kbybo60Y"
    step 0
    date "2013-01-20T04:10:43Z"
    title "Transgender at 11"
    description "Part two of our series surrounding Jazz, a young transgender girl who has know her gender identity since she was only a child. How will puberty affect Jazz's quest to live as a girl?&#10;&#10;Watch FULL EPISODES of ABC News broadcasts on Hulu: http://abcn.ws/3bzvQQn&#10;&#10;Like many teenage girls her age, Jazz Jennings spent time at the beach this summer and loves playing soccer with her friends, but she&#8217;s about to face a new challenge when she starts high school in the fall. &#8220;I&#8217;m a little bit worried because I&#8217;m not sure if people are going to be fully accepting,&#8221; she said. &#8220;I&#8217;ve noticed that boys are less accepting than girls.&#8221;Jazz is transgender, and at just 14 years old, she is staving off puberty and medically transitioning her body to female, the gender she identifies as, by taking estrogen and puberty blockers.&#10;&#10;The LGBTQ community is becoming a more vocal minority, looking for equal treatment on issues from marriage equality to anti-discrimination in the workplace. Watch stories about how the lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, and queer population aims to address stigma, discrimination and prejudice. See stories of hate crimes, health disparities, and violence against their marginalized groups. Turn to ABC News for the latest gay news, breaking stories on transgenders, and discussions on gender dysphoria. Join the discussion and find more about issues of sexual orientation, gender inequality and gender identity. Stay up to date with these videos and view all photos and more with with ABC News."
    channeltitle "ABC News"
