    label "uIuS-48tSpE"
    step 0
    date "2020-12-03T00:00:08Z"
    title "Growing Up Trans (full documentary) | FRONTLINE"
    description "Inside the struggles and choices facing transgender kids and their families, in an era where they have more medical options than ever before.&#10; &#10;This journalism is made possible by viewers like you. Support your local PBS station here: http://www.pbs.org/donate&#10; &#10;Just a generation ago, it was adults, not kids, who changed genders. But today, many children are transitioning, too &#8212; at younger and younger ages. Told from the perspective of parents, doctors and, most revealing of all, the kids themselves, FRONTLINE&#8217;s &#8220;Growing Up Trans&#8221; takes a look at how a new generation is navigating the changing and complicated world of gender and identity.&#10;&#10;#Documentary #GrowingUpTrans&#10;&#10;Love FRONTLINE? Find us on the PBS Video App where there are more than 300 FRONTLINE documentaries available for you to watch any time: https://to.pbs.org/FLVideoApp&#10;&#10;Subscribe on YouTube: http://bit.ly/1BycsJW&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/frontlinepbs&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/frontlinepbs&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/frontline&#10;&#10;Funding for FRONTLINE is provided through the support of PBS viewers and by the Corporation for Public Broadcasting. Major funding for FRONTLINE is provided by the John D. and Catherine T. MacArthur Foundation and the Ford Foundation. Additional funding is provided by the Abrams Foundation, the Park Foundation, The John and Helen Glessner Family Trust, and the FRONTLINE Journalism Fund with major support from Jon and Jo Ann Hagler on behalf of the Jon L. Hagler Foundation."
