    step 0
    date "2020-06-26T12:45:03Z"
    title "Transgender Women Share Stories From a Mens Prison | KQED Truly CA"
    description "At a men&#8217;s prison in Vacaville, California, about two dozen transgender women have been learning to live side-by-side with more than 2,000 cisgender men. Some live in huge dormitories, some in single cells. In spite of the daily challenges they face, they&#8217;re working to help change institutional policies and carve out a space where, even while incarcerated, they are free to be themselves.&#10;&#10;A film by Monica Z. Lam&#10;2020 Emmy Award Winner&#10;&#10;Hit that SUBSCRIBE button!&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=kqedart&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/kqedtrulyca&#13;&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://twitter.com/KQEDtrulyca"
