    title "ObGyn: Is Science Anti-Transgender?"
    description "For the duration of Pride, half of all merch revenue will be donated to the BLACK TRANS COALITION. Get yourself an inclusive science shirt. TRANS PRIDE: https://teespring.com/dark-trans-pride-science-is-in?tsmac=store&#38;tsmic=mamadoctorjones&#38;pid=211&#38;cid=103390 RAINBOW PRIDE: https://teespring.com/new-pride-science-is-inclusiv?tsmac=store&#38;tsmic=mamadoctorjones&#38;pid=211&#38;cid=5288 More Options: https://teespring.com/stores/mamadoctorjones&#10;&#10;&#10;Tweet Me: https://twitter.com/MamaDoctorJones/status/1270216394089660416?s=20&#10;&#10;RESOURCE LIST:&#10;1. Cornell Fact List &#38; Extensive Literature Review: &#10;https://whatweknow.inequality.cornell.edu/topics/lgbt-equality/what-does-the-scholarly-research-say-about-the-well-being-of-transgender-people/&#10;2. GLSEN Terminology Guide: https://www.glsen.org/sites/default/files/Gender%20Terminology%20Guide.pdf&#10;3. Gender Inclusive Language Help: http://lalzimman.com/papers/Zimman2017TransgenderLanguageReform.pdf&#10;4. Importance of Inclusive Providers: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00981389.2016.1193099&#10;5. Tweet Thread from ScienceVet2 Thread on Genetic Sex: https://twitter.com/ScienceVet2/status/1035246030500061184?s=20&#10;6. Supportive Medical Organizations: https://transcendlegal.org/medical-organization-statements&#10;Incidence of Sex Chromosome Abnormalities: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2090319/&#10;7. Mental Health Risks: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1300/J082v51n03_04&#10;8. Hormonal Transition &#38; Mental Health: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/19359705.2011.581195&#10;9. Transition Regret: https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1743609518300572&#10;10. Dispelling Myths Around Detransition: https://www.stonewall.org.uk/about-us/news/dispelling-myths-around-detransition&#10;11. ACOG Guidance: https://www.acog.org/clinical/clinical-guidance/committee-opinion/articles/2011/12/health-care-for-transgender-individuals&#10;12. Planned Parenthood Guide for Becoming A More Inclusive Healthcare Facility/Provider: https://www.plannedparenthood.org/files/4414/0606/9716/PPSFL_Providing_Transgender_Inclusive_Healthcare_Handbook.pdf&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;** The information in this video is intended to serve as educational information and is not intended or implied to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. All content, including text, graphics, images, and information, contained in this video is for general information purposes only and does not replace a consultation with your own doctor/advanced practice provider. **&#10;&#10;++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++"
