    description "Transforming Gender explores what it&#8217;s like to be in conflict with your assigned gender at birth. The fight for Transgender Rights is a huge struggle in the 21st century, In the last five years mainstream society is starting to acknowledge the Transgender community. &#10;&#10;Transgender people are among the most misunderstood, least protected people in our society. More than one in three transgender people attempts suicide at some point in their lives. But increasingly they are fighting back against the discrimination.&#10;&#10;Content licensed by Beyond to Little Dot Studios&#10;&#10;Real Pride celebrates the LGBTQ+ community around the world with amazing documentaries. &#10;&#10;For more documentaries that celebrate the LGBTQ+ community, subscribe here: https://tinyurl.com/RealPrideChannel"
