    date "2020-05-24T09:30:01Z"
    title "Male to female transformation Timeline (Transgender Woman-transition journey) | Jamie Casio"
    description "This is my story, a girl who was hiding herself in the closet, a girl who chose to live as a straight human before, trying to avoid hatred and rejection. Raised by religious parents  , and have always been discriminated for being soft and different. I've overcome it all.. watch to see how I made it!&#10;__________________________________________________________________&#10;I've been planning to upload this on June which is Pride month, but I can't help but upload and finally ,share it now, I'm just excited! I made this as an inspirational and somehow motivational, for I believe that my journey is not just all about being and transforming into a beautiful woman I am today, and I know that it is meant to be shared not just to my fellow trans women community, but to everyone, who is struggling in any aspects.&#10;___________________________________________________________________&#10;This video is NOT JUST ABOUT my transition, it's about how I bounced back, how I faced and encountered every battled while I was in every stage of transitioning.. an it was all worth it. &#10;___________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;Socials:&#10;Facebook: Jamie Concepcion Casi&#241;o&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/thejamiecasino&#10;Instagram: @thejamiecasino&#10;https://www.instagram.com/thejamiecasino/&#10;&#10;for business inquiries/ collaborations:&#10;thejamiecasino@gmail.com&#10;&#10;____________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;Spread Love not hate, dontcha forget to have Faith :*"
