    title "Four Myths About #Transgender Athletes, Debunked. Upholding #Trans Athletes Rights ... #shorts"
    description "&#129300; - Four Myths About #Transgender Athletes, Debunked. Upholding #trans athletes' rights requires rooting #out the inaccurate beliefs underlying harmful policies. - Chase Strangio &#38; Gabriel Arkles - https://tinyurl.com/27c5uhpt&#10;&#10;&#10067; - What's #DwhellOnIt?&#10;&#128064; - Dwhell On It is a series where I answer your questions about my lived experience as a #transgender woman!&#10;&#10;&#8252;&#65039; - Get engaged!&#10;&#10133; - Subscribe for more episodes &#38; similar content! -&#160;https://tinyurl.com/2eup8exm&#10;&#9993;&#65039; - Comment w/ thoughts &#38; questions!&#10;&#128077;&#127995; - Please like &#38; share!&#10;&#10;&#128279; - Links!&#10;International #Olympic Committee Framework on Fairness, Inclusion &#38; Non-Discrimination based on #Gender Identity and Sex Variations - https://tinyurl.com/4wwssdr7&#10;Kentucky banned #trans kids from #sports to keep this 12-year-old girl from playing #hockey - http://tinyurl.com/bdzzxvbm&#10;#Gender Verification in the #Olympics - https://tinyurl.com/2p8dnwdj&#10;Genital inspection provision to be removed from Ohio #transgender #athlete ban - https://tinyurl.com/2p9v6jcc&#10;#Canada is the first country to provide census data on #transgender &#38; #nonbinary #people. - https://tinyurl.com/yrapfkmn&#10;@Rugby Canada Provides Update on Feedback to #Transgender Athletes Guidelines - https://tinyurl.com/4948hmrb&#10;@Rugby Canada - #Trans Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/sp3cvyad&#10;Creating Inclusive Environments for #Trans Participants in #Canadian Sport - https://tinyurl.com/2p9hcf6c&#10;The ban violates the #humanrights of #transgender &#38; #gender-diverse women. - @Canadian Women &#38; Sport and @Canadian Centre for Ethics in Sport / CCES - https://tinyurl.com/4hrhbvf7&#10;@International Rugby League Bans #Transgender Women from Participating - https://tinyurl.com/yc56pb6y&#10;@Canada Rugby League Association Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/2aush2cp&#10;@U SPORTS Approves Inclusive New Policy For #Transgender Student-Athletes - http://tinyurl.com/yc5ebr4w&#10;Policy on Eligibility for The Men's &#38; Women's Competition Categories - https://tinyurl.com/yt7nj688&#10;Homeless rates for 2SLGBTQIA+ teens are alarming, but #parents can make a difference. - https://tinyurl.com/4u62mj9k&#10;2022 National Survey on 2SLGBTQIA+ Youth #MentalHealth - https://tinyurl.com/4abafnsb&#10;A study shows #transgender youth have high parental support but lack access to #care. - https://tinyurl.com/3wecjr9y&#10;What do pubertal blockers do? - https://tinyurl.com/4v7tm2pa&#10;#Transgender Youth Referred to Clinics for #Gender-Affirming #Medical #Care in #Canada - https://tinyurl.com/yusabpxn&#10;#Trans #healthcare in #Canada needs significant improvements. - https://tinyurl.com/2zz5msnj&#10;My Call to Action for #Trans Day of Visibility! - http://tinyurl.com/54u5wxkk&#10;Definition of &#34;fairness&#34; (noun) - https://tinyurl.com/ytn62frb&#10;Tommy Tuberville's Pathetic Attempt to Attack #Transgender Kids Nationwide Fails. - https://tinyurl.com/t2fectej&#10;#Trans #people face growing backlash, high violence, discrimination &#38; poverty levels. - https://tinyurl.com/2s4hestz&#10;Experiences of violent victimization and unwanted sexual behaviours among gay, #lesbian, #bisexual &#38; other sexual minority #people and the #transgender population - https://tinyurl.com/2rsaa2mp&#10;A statistical portrait of #Canada's diverse 2SLGBTQIA+ communities. https://tinyurl.com/3k2t7pvv&#10;@FINA1908 votes to restrict #trans participation in elite women's competition. - https://tinyurl.com/4u89rwk4&#10;@Sport Canada funds many organizations that nationally represent #Canada's #sports system through the Sport Support Program. - https://tinyurl.com/mtt7b6vd&#10;@Water Polo Canada Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/35cua7fr&#10;@Swimming Canada - #Equity, Diversity &#38; Inclusion - https://tinyurl.com/yc3nutef&#10;@Diving Canada - #Equity, Diversity &#38; Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/a2j8psfn&#10;@Canada Artistic Swimming #Equity, Diversity &#38; Inclusion Policy - https://tinyurl.com/5n6s22xw&#10;@Sport Canada discontinues survey on inclusion after complaints of discrimination toward #transgender athletes. - https://tinyurl.com/2p8ds2pd&#10;Let's Talk About #Sports, Emm Bee! - http://tinyurl.com/44xn76r2.&#10;Does @Sport Manitoba Fund Non-Inclusive PSOs? - http://tinyurl.com/44xn76r2&#10;#Canada's #government provides updates &#38; announces action about safe sport. - https://tinyurl.com/m8u4p3rc&#10;From the London Declaration - &#34;Expectations for Fairness in Sport.&#34; - https://tinyurl.com/3678d7ds&#10;Red Deer Declaration - For the Prevention of Harassment, Abuse &#38; Discrimination in Sport - https://tinyurl.com/2p8uyhzm&#10;Allyship as #activism: advancing #social #change in global sport through transformational allyship. - https://tinyurl.com/ym6wt98c&#10;&#10;&#128113;&#127996;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; - Look me up!&#10;@TaylorLakhryst: #Transgender woman, advocate, INFJ, &#9802;&#65039;, she/her/hers &#127987;&#65039;&#8205;&#9895;&#65039;&#10;Linktree:&#160;https://linktr.ee/TaylorLakhryst&#10;&#10;#IOC #FINA #CCES #active #anxiety #athlete #college #culture #donate #education #environment #equality #features #help #heritage #justice #leaders #LGBT #LGBTQ #news #out #parenting #perspective #press #respect #science #swim #swimming #therapy #water #healthylifestyle #humanrights"
