    title "God delivered me from the Transgender lifestyle."
    description "Hello everyone. I hope that all is well. I had a vision to create a safe place where Christians can boldly share their faith and what the Lord has done in their lives. To the glory of God, I have started a program called &#34;Still I Rise&#34; where every Sunday night I present to you a new testimony of people who have overcome. Link to the channel below.&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=loth8YGuqEg&#10;&#10;I would like to continue to expand this vision, so I am asking if you can help me make this vision a reality. Any donation will be gladly accepted. It does not have to be money; the item itself would also be a blessing. Let the Spirit of God guide you. Below I have included a PayPal account and also some of the items I need.&#10;&#10;I want to Thank each and everyone of you guys. Sharing, liking and subscribing to the channel, is also a way that you can help me expand and grow this platform.&#10;&#10;My PAYPAL NAME IS @ RICARDOSIMMSMINISTRY or you can click the link below. I want to thank you in advance.&#10;&#10;https://paypal.me/Ricardosimmsministry&#10;&#10;Amazon wish-list below&#10;&#10;https://www.amazon.fr/hz/wishlist/ls/28Q7Z8SQSWH2?ref_=wl_share&#10;&#10;As a child, I struggled with my gender identity, as a result of that, I later transitioned into a female. I lived as a woman for most of my life, in 2020 I had an encounter with Jesus Christ, where he showed me the afterlife, and where people will go if they didn't choose him, even though this experience terrified me to death, that was not the reason why I walked away from my old lifestyle. &#10;&#10;It was the love that God showed to me that propelled me to change. As results of that I now have peace, joy, and happiness. &#65532;&#65532;"
